{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer this land with your courage and wisdom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiadh\u00a0and her mother lived peacefully in the Magic Forest. One day, her mother ventured to the Sealed Mountain to investigate strange disturbances but never returned. Now, Fiadh must embark on her own journey to uncover the truth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Forest Homecoming</strong></i> is a classic-style 2D action-adventure game set in a vast\u00a0world. Explore the magical forest, desolate deserts, and perilous underground kingdoms. Battle creatures corrupted by dark magic, meet friendly creatures\u00a0who have\u00a0their own goals, and delve into the secrets of the Sealed Mountain\u00a0to ultimately\u00a0save the forest's inhabitants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/5f2025ef8a41be2037622d19bbeac24c.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/5f2025ef8a41be2037622d19bbeac24c.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/5f2025ef8a41be2037622d19bbeac24c.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>**Game Features**</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Classic side-scrolling</strong></i> levels with a unique artistic style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Smooth\u00a02D controls:</strong></i> Dodge attacks and use\u00a0magical abilities to defeat foes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/e0ca794e254093286b4b3773defd50e5.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/e0ca794e254093286b4b3773defd50e5.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/e0ca794e254093286b4b3773defd50e5.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Explore a vast</strong></i>, interconnected\u00a0world: Travel through\u00a0lush forests,\u00a0barren deserts,\u00a0and mysterious\u00a0underworlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shape your own adventure!</i></strong> The Magic Forest is an\u00a0expansive world where you can choose your path and challenges.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/a24c7dea82fed1ebff23cfbb0eba5378.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/a24c7dea82fed1ebff23cfbb0eba5378.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/a24c7dea82fed1ebff23cfbb0eba5378.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Master new abilities!</i></strong> Befriend creatures,\u00a0learn magic,\u00a0and\u00a0enhance your strength and speed. Leap to new heights, sprint with agility,\u00a0and\u00a0unleash magical blasts\u00a0upon your enemies!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/037c8200a4a2eacc09193ecc96de457b.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/037c8200a4a2eacc09193ecc96de457b.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/037c8200a4a2eacc09193ecc96de457b.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong><i>Equip\u00a0powerful items!</i></strong> These\u00a0treasures can give you unique abilities. Choose your favorites and start your journey!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/44cadcd54f9778aa92fed91abdd8396d.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/44cadcd54f9778aa92fed91abdd8396d.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/44cadcd54f9778aa92fed91abdd8396d.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Vibrant 2D animation</i></strong>\u00a0brings life to cute characters, but be careful\u2014they may pack a punch!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/275f0a9b6f732fbdb95ee174e2de6015.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/275f0a9b6f732fbdb95ee174e2de6015.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/275f0a9b6f732fbdb95ee174e2de6015.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a\u00a0wonderfully\u00a0handcrafted world!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every region\u00a0is marvelous and special, filled with new creatures and characters to encounter. Marvel at the scenery while\u00a0discovering\u00a0hidden worlds beneath familiar paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like\u00a0classic gameplay, charming\u00a0yet combative\u00a0characters, unknown\u00a0adventures, and beautiful\u00a02D landscapes\u2014Forest\u00a0Homecoming\u00a0awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3885060?t=1755933786","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3885060?t=1755933786","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/770fb0feb69708512ec97f32d1b1b229128e4f2a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755933786","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/770fb0feb69708512ec97f32d1b1b229128e4f2a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755933786","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer this land with your courage and wisdom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiadh\u00a0and her mother lived peacefully in the Magic Forest. One day, her mother ventured to the Sealed Mountain to investigate strange disturbances but never returned. Now, Fiadh must embark on her own journey to uncover the truth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Forest Homecoming</strong></i> is a classic-style 2D action-adventure game set in a vast\u00a0world. Explore the magical forest, desolate deserts, and perilous underground kingdoms. Batt