\u00a0underworlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shape your own adventure!</i></strong> The Magic Forest is an\u00a0expansive world where you can choose your path and challenges.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/a24c7dea82fed1ebff23cfbb0eba5378.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/a24c7dea82fed1ebff23cfbb0eba5378.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/a24c7dea82fed1ebff23cfbb0eba5378.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Master new abilities!</i></strong> Befriend creatures,\u00a0learn magic,\u00a0and\u00a0enhance your strength and speed. Leap to new heights, sprint with agility,\u00a0and\u00a0unleash magical blasts\u00a0upon your enemies!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/037c8200a4a2eacc09193ecc96de457b.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/037c8200a4a2eacc09193ecc96de457b.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/037c8200a4a2eacc09193ecc96de457b.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong><i>Equip\u00a0powerful items!</i></strong> These\u00a0treasures can give you unique abilities. Choose your favorites and start your journey!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https